      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The lumber boom hit Gould City in 1905, spawning dozens of sawmills and turning the town into a timber powerhouse.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gould_City%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1929 fire razed most historic structures, leaving only a handful of pre‑fire buildings standing today.",
