      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gould_City%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the 1940s Route 2 was built just north of Gould City, giving the community a major highway link.",
